  diseaseId: food_poisoning
  diseaseName: "GIDA ZEH\u0130RLENMES\u0130"
  generalInfo: "G\u0131da zehirlenmesi, kontamine yiyecek veya i\xE7ecek t\xFCketimi
    sonras\u0131 geli\u015Fen akut sindirim sistemi hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r.
    Hastalarda kar\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131, bulant\u0131 ve ishal g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "Akut ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 olmas\u0131, ishal mevcut olmas\u0131,
    bulant\u0131 ve kusma ve \xFCst kar\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 var olmas\u0131
    g\u0131da zehirlenmesinde s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir. Baz\u0131
    hastalarda hafif ate\u015F mevcut olabilir."
